.\n\nSo, enumerator is limited to:\n\n~ **Anti-diagonal integers (minimal values within multiples)**: \\( 1000 \\) (checking sampled fables 1000<<4) \n\nThus, Josef must choose:\n\\[\n\\boxed{250}\n\\]\n\nnumbers within multiples total 1000 and quotient vital to be integer always.",
